      "path": "e2e/d8r/names.spec.ts",
      "content": "This filters labels through the same broker-format regex that the test is meant to validate. For example, visible `XYZ Dec 18 $55 Call` with an incorrect `aria-label=\"XYZ 2026-12-18 55 Call\"` still passes: the label produces no matches, so `expectNamed` never checks it. It also omits `alt` and does not resolve multiple `aria-labelledby` references into the resulting accessible name. Assert the full accessible name of each contract-bearing element against its visible name (for example with `toHaveAccessibleName`) rather than checking only matching substrings, so B8R.5 detects alternative screen-reader spellings.",
